section -- merged from Development.AbelianVarietyTheory.Proofs.FlagMeasures.ExistsContinuousBesselMapSmoothVectors
open MeasureTheory Matrix Formalism.QuantumDeterminants Formalism.MainNotions.S GlobalTheory.SgInf
